# Scratch queue rows SMK (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.2): T1 smoke rows, one section per own jar. Data: the queue table
# in scratch_queue.md is generated from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py
# docstring. Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/SMK.qb RES [--section KEY] [--tier T1] [--rows ID,...]
# Group A (superflat, prep_srv.sh). Blocks go in a forceloaded area of their own: x 9000..9100, z 9000..9100, one x
# column per section (9000 + 6 x (KEY - 1)), y -60 on the flat surface. The first block row of each section forceloads it.

@@section 1
@@title SQ-SMK Creative Common smoke rows, 2026-11-16 ([plan_process_overhaul.md](../plan_process_overhaul.md) P2.2)
@@date 2026-11-16
@@sources development/creativeCommon
@@tier T1
@@text Creative Common boots with its mixins and script pack, registers its potions and effect, and `/ccswap items` rewrites a merged stack.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-SMK-01 | Common boots: setup lines, swaps report, mixins, no error naming it
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `logs/latest.log` for the Common setup and `[swaps]` lines; count `from creativecommon.mixins.json` in `logs/debug.log`
@pass `CreativeCommon setup complete`; `[swaps] load report: every listed id resolved`; `[melting] tags:` and `[damage-tags] loaded` lines; jar found with `{creativecommon}`; at least one mixin applied; no ERROR line or mixin failure naming `creativecommon`
@fails Jar missing or broken mods.toml, a mixin target renamed, a swap list id that no longer resolves
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect CreativeCommon setup complete
bootexpect \[swaps\] load report: every listed id resolved
bootexpect \[melting\] tags: \d+ meltable
bootexpect \[damage-tags\] loaded [1-9]\d* data-defined tag
bootreject /ERROR\].*\bcreativecommon\b
bootreject (Mixin apply.*failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|MixinTransformerError).*\bcreativecommon
bootreject \[CE potions\] .* not found while building
shell grep -q "Found valid mod file creativecommon-[^ ]*\.jar with .creativecommon." logs/debug.log
shell echo "mixins $(grep -c 'from creativecommon.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)"; test "$(grep -c 'from creativecommon.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)" -gt 0

## SQ-SMK-02 | Common script pack: helpers and dicts load from the jar
@group A
@commands Same boot: grep `logs/latest.log` for the `[jar-startup]` lines and the tag helper's summary
@pass `[jar-startup] creativecommon: N of N files loaded from its jar` (both numbers equal); the pack order line starts with `creativecommon`; `neoCraftHelper.js` loaded; the tag helper reports `[minecraft:item] Found N tags, added N objects`
@fails `kubejs_startup/creativecommon/` missing from the jar, a helper throwing at load, JarStartupScripts not run
bootexpect \[jar-startup\] creativecommon: (\d+) of \1 files loaded from its jar
bootexpect \[jar-startup\] startup script packs in order: creativecommon,
bootexpect Loaded script creativecommon:creativecommon/func/neoCraftHelper\.js
bootexpect \[minecraft:item\] Found [1-9]\d* tags, added [1-9]\d* objects

## SQ-SMK-03 | Common registers Magic Resistance and its potions
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest reg effect ^creativecommon:magic_resistance$`; `/cdevtest reg potion ^creativecommon: max=1`; `/cdevtest potion creativecommon:strong_resistance`; `/cdevtest potion creativecommon:long_magic_resistance`
@pass the effect is registered (`n=1`); 30 or more `creativecommon` potions (33 on 2026-11-15); both potions `registered=true`
@fails `CommonPotions` rows not registered (effect lookup null at potion registration), magic_resistance.js not run
> cdevtest reg effect ^creativecommon:magic_resistance$
> cdevtest reg potion ^creativecommon: max=1
> cdevtest potion creativecommon:strong_resistance
> cdevtest potion creativecommon:long_magic_resistance
expect verb=reg kind=effect regex=\S+ n=1\b
expect verb=reg kind=potion regex=\S+ n=(3\d|[4-9]\d)\b
expect verb=potion potion=creativecommon:strong_resistance registered=true
expect verb=potion potion=creativecommon:long_magic_resistance registered=true

## SQ-SMK-04 | /ccswap items rewrites a merged stack in a chest
@group A
@commands `forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100`; chest at 9000 -60 9010 with `alexsmobs:banana` x3 in slot 0; `/ccswap items`; `/cdevtest inv 9000 -60 9010`
@pass `[swaps] /ccswap items: N stack(s) rewritten` with N at least 1; slot 0 holds `neapolitan:banana*3`
@fails Swap lists not read (no merge pairs: command rewrites 0), chunk not tracked by `ItemMerges.onChunkLoad`, Container rewrite path broken
> forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100
sleep 5
> setblock 9000 -60 9010 minecraft:chest
> item replace block 9000 -60 9010 container.0 with alexsmobs:banana 3
> ccswap items
> cdevtest inv 9000 -60 9010
expect \[swaps\] /ccswap items: [1-9]\d* stack\(s\) rewritten
expect verb=inv slot=0 item=neapolitan:banana\*3
reject Unknown or incomplete command

@@section 2
@@title SQ-SMK Creative Engineering smoke rows, 2026-11-16 ([plan_process_overhaul.md](../plan_process_overhaul.md) P2.2)
@@date 2026-11-16
@@sources development/creativeEngineering
@@tier T1
@@text Creative Engineering boots with its mixins and scripts, registers its items and blocks, carries its recipes and the dragon breathing type, and its blocks place and drop.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-SMK-05 | Engineering boots: loaded line, script pack, mixins, no error naming it
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `logs/latest.log` for `[creativeengineering]` and `[jar-startup] creativeengineering`; count `from creativeengineering.mixins.json` in `logs/debug.log`
@pass `[creativeengineering] loaded`; `core finished`; `N of N files loaded from its jar`; jar found with `{creativeengineering}`; at least one mixin applied; no ERROR line or mixin failure naming `creativeengineering`
@fails Jar missing, a mixin target renamed (IE, Create, JEI), a startup script throwing
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativeengineering\] loaded
bootexpect \[creativeengineering\] core finished
bootexpect \[jar-startup\] creativeengineering: (\d+) of \1 files loaded from its jar
bootreject /ERROR\].*\bcreativeengineering\b
bootreject (Mixin apply.*failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|MixinTransformerError).*\bcreativeengineering
shell grep -q "Found valid mod file creativeengineering-[^ ]*\.jar with .creativeengineering." logs/debug.log
shell echo "mixins $(grep -c 'from creativeengineering.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)"; test "$(grep -c 'from creativeengineering.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)" -gt 0

## SQ-SMK-06 | Engineering items and blocks registered
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest reg item ^creativeengineering: max=1`; `/cdevtest reg block ^creativeengineering: max=1`; `/cdevtest item creativeengineering:precision_sawblade`
@pass 70 or more items (81 on 2026-11-15), 35 or more blocks (40); the sawblade is a `PrecisionSawbladeItem`
@fails A startup items script not run (KubeJS registry), `CreativeEngineeringItems` not registered
> cdevtest reg item ^creativeengineering: max=1
> cdevtest reg block ^creativeengineering: max=1
> cdevtest item creativeengineering:precision_sawblade
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=\S+ n=([7-9]\d|[1-9]\d{2,})\b
expect verb=reg kind=block regex=\S+ n=(3[5-9]|[4-9]\d|[1-9]\d{2,})\b
expect verb=item item=creativeengineering:precision_sawblade class=com\.SaintAlfonzo\.creativeengineering\.item\.PrecisionSawbladeItem

## SQ-SMK-07 | Engineering recipes and the dragon breathing type
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest recipes creativeengineering: max=1`; `/cdevtest bytype creativeengineering:dragon_breathing max=1`; `/cdevtest makes creativeengineering:iron_wire`
@pass 1500 or more `creativeengineering` recipes (1804 on 2026-11-15); 10 or more dragon breathing recipes (14); at least one recipe makes iron wire
@fails Server scripts not in the jar (`data/creativeengineering/kubejs/`), the dragon breathing serializer not registered
> cdevtest recipes creativeengineering: max=1
> cdevtest bytype creativeengineering:dragon_breathing max=1
> cdevtest makes creativeengineering:iron_wire
expect verb=recipes text=creativeengineering: n=(1[5-9]\d\d|[2-9]\d{3}|\d{5,})\b
expect verb=bytype serializer=creativeengineering:dragon_breathing n=([1-9]\d+)\b
expect verb=makes item=creativeengineering:iron_wire n=[1-9]\d*\b

## SQ-SMK-08 | an Engineering plate block places and drops itself
@group A
@commands `forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100`; `/cdevtest place 9006 -60 9010 creativeengineering:steel_plate_block`; `/cdevtest state`; `/cdevtest break 9006 -60 9010 held=minecraft:iron_pickaxe`
@pass placed, state `creativeengineering:steel_plate_block`; broken with the pickaxe, drops one `creativeengineering:steel_plate_block`
@fails Block not registered, no loot table, wrong mineable tag
> forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100
sleep 5
> cdevtest place 9006 -60 9010 creativeengineering:steel_plate_block
> cdevtest state 9006 -60 9010
> cdevtest break 9006 -60 9010 held=minecraft:iron_pickaxe
expect verb=place placed=true state="?creativeengineering:steel_plate_block
expect verb=state pos=9006,-60,9010 state="?creativeengineering:steel_plate_block
expect verb=break .*broken=true
expect verb=break .*drops=creativeengineering:steel_plate_block:1

