shell echo "mixins $(grep -c 'from creativeequipment.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)"; test "$(grep -c 'from creativeequipment.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)" -gt 0

## SQ-SMK-10 | Equipment items: echo pickaxe and copper shield are real gear
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest reg item ^creativeequipment: max=1`; `/cdevtest item creativeequipment:echo_pickaxe`; `/cdevtest attrs creativeequipment:echo_pickaxe`; `/cdevtest item creativeequipment:copper_shield`
@pass 25 or more items (30 on 2026-11-15); the pickaxe and the shield have durability; the pickaxe has a main-hand attack damage modifier
@fails Tier or shield registration broken (durability 0), `tuneTools` not applied
> cdevtest reg item ^creativeequipment: max=1
> cdevtest item creativeequipment:echo_pickaxe
> cdevtest attrs creativeequipment:echo_pickaxe
> cdevtest item creativeequipment:copper_shield
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=\S+ n=(2[5-9]|[3-9]\d|[1-9]\d{2,})\b
expect verb=item item=creativeequipment:echo_pickaxe class=\S+ max_damage=[1-9]\d*
expect verb=attrs slot=mainhand attribute=minecraft:generic\.attack_damage
expect verb=item item=creativeequipment:copper_shield class=\S+ max_damage=[1-9]\d*

## SQ-SMK-11 | Equipment recipes and the stepstool tag
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest recipes creativeequipment: max=1`; `/cdevtest makes creativeequipment:copper_shield`; `/cdevtest makes creativeequipment:white_stepstool`; `/cdevtest tag item creativeequipment:stepstools`
@pass 140 or more `creativeequipment` recipes (167 on 2026-11-15); a recipe for the copper shield and for the white stepstool; the stepstool tag holds 16 items
@fails Server scripts not in the jar (`data/creativeequipment/kubejs/`), tag file missing
> cdevtest recipes creativeequipment: max=1
> cdevtest makes creativeequipment:copper_shield
> cdevtest makes creativeequipment:white_stepstool
> cdevtest tag item creativeequipment:stepstools
expect verb=recipes text=creativeequipment: n=(1[4-9]\d|[2-9]\d\d|\d{4,})\b
expect verb=makes item=creativeequipment:copper_shield n=[1-9]\d*\b
expect verb=makes item=creativeequipment:white_stepstool n=[1-9]\d*\b
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativeequipment:stepstools n=16\b

