## SQ-SMK-15 | Labels boots: jar found, mixins, no error naming it
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `logs/debug.log` for the jar and `from creativelabels.mixins.json`; grep `logs/latest.log` for errors
@pass jar found with `{creativelabels}`; at least one mixin applied; no ERROR line or mixin failure naming `creativelabels`; no tag load error for `creativelabels:paper/` tags
@fails Jar missing, a mixin target renamed, a broken tag file
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject /ERROR\].*\bcreativelabels\b
bootreject (Mixin apply.*failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|MixinTransformerError).*\bcreativelabels
bootreject Couldn't load tag creativelabels:
shell grep -q "Found valid mod file creativeLabels-[^ ]*\.jar with .creativelabels." logs/debug.log
shell echo "mixins $(grep -c 'from creativelabels.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)"; test "$(grep -c 'from creativelabels.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)" -gt 0

## SQ-SMK-16 | Labels items, paper block and recipes
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest reg item ^creativelabels:`; `/cdevtest reg block ^creativelabels:face_paper$`; `/cdevtest makes creativelabels:sticky_note`; `/cdevtest makes creativelabels:label`
@pass three items (`sticky_note`, `label`, `eraser`); the `face_paper` block; a recipe makes 2 sticky notes and one makes 16 labels
@fails `CLRegistry` not run, the pack's `other/creative_labels.js` recipes missing (they come from the pack's server scripts, not the jar)
> cdevtest reg item ^creativelabels:
> cdevtest reg block ^creativelabels:face_paper$
> cdevtest makes creativelabels:sticky_note
> cdevtest makes creativelabels:label
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=\S+ n=3\b
expect verb=reg kind=item id=creativelabels:sticky_note
expect verb=reg kind=block regex=\S+ n=1\b
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=creativelabels:sticky_note\*2
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=creativelabels:label\*16

## SQ-SMK-17 | a sticky note places as face paper
@group A
@commands `forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100`; `setblock 9024 -61 9010 minecraft:stone`; `/cdevtest use 9024 -61 9010 held=creativelabels:sticky_note face=up`; `/cdevtest state 9024 -60 9010`
@pass the use returns CONSUME; the cell above is `creativelabels:face_paper` with block entity `creativelabels:face_paper`
@fails `FacePaperInteractions.placeNote` refused the top face (`Spots.fit`), block entity not registered
> forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100
sleep 5
> setblock 9024 -61 9010 minecraft:stone
> setblock 9024 -60 9010 minecraft:air
> cdevtest use 9024 -61 9010 held=creativelabels:sticky_note face=up
> cdevtest state 9024 -60 9010
expect verb=use .*result=(CONSUME|SUCCESS)
expect verb=state pos=9024,-60,9010 state="?creativelabels:face_paper.* be=creativelabels:face_paper

