@pass `[creativecompat] loaded (config/creativecompat-common.toml)`; `N of N files loaded from its jar`; `[paintings] N of M modded painting variants built`; `[surface] N tier speeds applied to BlockRunner`; `[feature-ports] tier 1: N recipes`; jar found; at least one mixin applied; no ERROR line or mixin failure naming `creativecompat`
