## SQ-SMK-23 | season biome tags are filled
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tag biome creativecalendar:seasons/arid`; `/cdevtest tag biome creativecalendar:seasons/frozen`
@pass the arid tag holds `minecraft:desert`; the frozen tag is not empty
@fails `SeasonTypes` tag data missing from the jar or the pack
