@commands `forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100`; `/cdevtest place 9072 -60 9010 powergrid:battery`; `/cdevtest state 9072 -60 9010`
@pass placed as `powergrid:battery` with a `powergrid` block entity
@fails Block or block entity not registered, electrical node setup throwing on placement
> forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100
sleep 5
> cdevtest place 9072 -60 9010 powergrid:battery
> cdevtest state 9072 -60 9010
expect verb=place placed=true state="?powergrid:battery
expect verb=state pos=9072,-60,9010 .*be=powergrid:
reject /ERROR\].*\b(powergrid|patryk3211)\b

