@fails Block entity type (`EntityTypesRegistry`) not bound to the block, container broken
> forceload add 9000 9000 9100 9100
sleep 5
> cdevtest place 9084 -60 9010 storagedelight:acacia_drawer
> cdevtest state 9084 -60 9010
> item replace block 9084 -60 9010 container.0 with minecraft:apple 3
> cdevtest inv 9084 -60 9010
