@@table
## SQ-SMK-54 | Raspberry Pie boots: diet ladder, mixins
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `logs/latest.log` for `Diet ladder`; count `from solraspberrypie.mixins.json` in `logs/debug.log`
@pass `Diet ladder: N rungs, N slots, N pool effects`; no `DIET LADDER FILE IS BROKEN OR MISSING`; jar found; at least one mixin applied; no Apple Pie benefit or reset warning; no ERROR line or mixin failure naming `solraspberrypie`
@fails Jar missing, `ladder.json` unreadable (built-in ladder used), Apple Pie mixin target renamed
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect Diet ladder: [1-9]\d* rungs, [1-9]\d* slots, \d+ pool effects
bootreject DIET LADDER FILE IS BROKEN OR MISSING
bootreject Apple Pie still has its own benefits
bootreject Apple Pie resetOnDeath is true
bootreject /ERROR\].*\bsolraspberrypie\b
bootreject (Mixin apply.*failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|MixinTransformerError).*\bsolraspberrypie
shell grep -q "Found valid mod file solRaspberryPie-[^ ]*\.jar with .solraspberrypie." logs/debug.log
shell echo "mixins $(grep -c 'from solraspberrypie.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)"; test "$(grep -c 'from solraspberrypie.mixins.json' logs/debug.log)" -gt 0

## SQ-SMK-55 | /solrp pause list answers
@group A
@commands `/solrp pause list`
@pass `No player has paused diet bonuses` or `N paused: ...`; no unknown command
@fails `RpCommands` not registered
> solrp pause list
sleep 2
expect No player has paused diet bonuses|\d+ paused: |solraspberrypie\.cmd\.(none_paused|paused_list)
reject Unknown or incomplete command

