@pass two items (`diet_marker`, `liquid_diet_log`); a recipe makes the liquid diet log; one diet book recipe
@fails Items not registered, the diet book serializer missing
> cdevtest reg item ^solraspberrypie:
> cdevtest makes solraspberrypie:liquid_diet_log
> cdevtest bytype solraspberrypie:diet_book max=1
